B4 — Memory API

State validated:
- Adds bounded memory.list/read/write/archive to the public extension API.
- Scope is resolved in Rust from the active turn; extensions can only select global or the already-resolved project scope.
- Reads and writes reuse MemoryRuntime policy, shared turn result budget, existing store lock, path validation, parsing and index ownership.
